  "purpose": "Authored fallback roster of human doctors, used when a deployment has no doctor directory configured or the configured directory is unreachable. A doctor is a person; each employment/practice relationship is a separate affiliation that names the employing organization, the Appbase med_hospital code, the department, the rank, and whether the engagement is full-time or part-time. Every client ships this exact roster; `tests/doctor-directory.test.mjs` asserts the TypeScript, Dart, and mini program copies equal this file. A deployment binds its own directory through the runtime document key `careDoctorDirectoryUrl`.",
